---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout lang="en" title="Four NACUAA Chapters Form Sister Chapter Alliance & Establish Strategic Partnership with ZJUAANC | NACUAA Greater Washington DC Chapter (NACUAADC)" description="On September 12, 2026, NACUAA Northern California, Silicon Valley, North Carolina, and Greater Washington DC chapters officially established a Sister Chapter Alliance. Concurrently, ZJUAANC established a comprehensive strategic partnership with all four chapters." path="/en/posts/2026-09-12-four-chapters-sisterhood-and-zju-strategic-partnership/">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 md:py-20">
    <a href="/en/news/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-x-2 text-sm text-blue-500 hover:text-blue-400 mb-8 transition-colors">
      <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-left"></i>
      <span>Back to News</span>
    </a>

    <article class="space-y-8">
      <header class="border-b border-slate-900 pb-8 space-y-4">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-x-3 text-xs text-slate-500 mb-2 flex-wrap gap-y-1">
          <time datetime="2026-09-12">Saturday, September 12, 2026</time>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>Lunar August 2nd</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span class="px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-blue-600/10 text-blue-400 border border-blue-500/20 font-semibold">Major News</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white leading-tight">
          Four NACUAA Chapters Form Sister Chapter Alliance & Establish Strategic Partnership with ZJUAANC
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base text-blue-400 font-medium">
          East Meets West · North-South Synergy · Connecting Activities · Sharing Resources · Supporting Alumni
        </p>
      </header>

      <!-- Key Highlight Card -->
      <div class="p-6 md:p-8 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-950/50 via-slate-900 to-indigo-950/50 border border-blue-500/30 rounded-3xl space-y-6 shadow-2xl">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-600/20 border border-blue-500/30 flex items-center justify-center text-blue-400 text-lg shrink-0">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake"></i>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h2 class="text-lg md:text-xl font-bold text-white">Two Major Milestones Established Simultaneously</h2>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400">September 12, 2026 · Lunar August 2nd</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-blue-400 font-semibold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-users"></i>
              <span>Sister Chapter Alliance</span>
            </span>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              NACUAA Northern California, Silicon Valley, North Carolina, and Greater Washington DC chapters officially form a Sister Chapter Alliance.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-950/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
            <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold text-sm flex items-center gap-1.5">
              <i class="fa-solid fa-graduation-cap"></i>
              <span>ZJUAANC Strategic Expansion</span>
            </span>
            <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Zhejiang University Alumni Association of North Carolina (ZJUAANC) expands its strategic partnership across all four chapters nationwide.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Body Text -->
      <div class="text-slate-300 space-y-6 leading-relaxed text-base">
        <p class="text-lg text-slate-200 font-medium">
          On September 12, 2026 (Saturday, Lunar August 2nd), a historic milestone was achieved for cross-regional collegiate alumni collaboration in North America: <strong>NACUAA Northern California, Silicon Valley, North Carolina, and Greater Washington DC chapters</strong> formally resolved to enter into a <strong>Sister Chapter Alliance</strong>.
        </p>

        <p>
          On the same day, <strong>Zhejiang University Alumni Association of North Carolina (ZJUAANC)</strong> established an official <strong>strategic partnership</strong> with all four chapters. Previously, ZJUAANC collaborated predominantly with the North Carolina chapter; through this strategic expansion, collaboration now extends across Northern California, Silicon Valley, North Carolina, and Greater Washington DC to serve alumni across regions.
        </p>

        <!-- Sister Chapters Grid -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-earth-americas text-blue-400"></i>
            <span>The Four Sister Chapters</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
            Covering four major technology, innovation, academic, and economic powerhouses in North America:
          </p>

          <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4 text-xs">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Northern California Chapter</span>
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-medium">President: Michael Huo</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Serving the Greater SF Bay Area and Northern California, driving tech entrepreneurship, club ecosystems, and community engagement.
              </p>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">norcal.nacuaa.ai</div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Silicon Valley Chapter</span>
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-medium">President: Dr. Qilei Peng</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Gathering innovators and engineering leaders from top tech firms to spearhead cutting-edge AI and industry initiatives.
              </p>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">sv.nacuaa.ai</div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">North Carolina Chapter</span>
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-medium">President: Rose Li</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Anchored in the Research Triangle Park (RTP) and renowned academic institutions, fostering southeastern alumni synergy.
              </p>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">nc.nacuaa.ai</div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-2">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                <span class="font-bold text-white text-sm">Greater Washington DC Chapter</span>
                <span class="text-blue-400 font-medium">President: Bin Liu</span>
              </div>
              <p class="text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
                Radiating across the DC metropolitan area, connecting leaders in technology, finance, policy, and research.
              </p>
              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-500 font-mono">dc.nacuaa.ai</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Three Core Principles -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-4">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-compass text-blue-400"></i>
            <span>Three Core Strategic Pillars</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400">
            The alliance is founded on three mutual commitments:
          </p>

          <div class="space-y-3 text-sm">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/80 flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-calendar-check"></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white">1. Connecting Activities</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                  Regularly co-hosting and cross-promoting academic forums, tech webinars, entrepreneurship workshops, and community events across both coasts.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/80 flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-indigo-500/10 text-indigo-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-share-nodes"></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white">2. Sharing Resources</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                  Fully opening club networks including AI Club (<a href="/en/ai" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">/ai</a>), Guandan Club (<a href="/en/guandan" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">/guandan</a>), Run & Hike Club (<a href="/en/run" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">/run</a>), Music Club (<a href="/en/music" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">/music</a>), Pickleball Club (<a href="/en/pickleball" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">/pickleball</a>), and Golf Club (<a href="/en/posts/2026-08-27-golf-club-announcement/" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline">/golf</a>).
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="p-4 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/40 border border-slate-800/80 flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <i class="fa-solid fa-heart"></i>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h4 class="font-bold text-white">3. Supporting Alumni</h4>
                <p class="text-slate-400 text-xs mt-1 leading-relaxed">
                  Establishing mutual-aid channels for alumni relocating across regions, new graduates entering the job market, mentoring, and cross-state career development.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Strategic Partnership with ZJUAANC -->
        <div class="space-y-4 pt-4 border-t border-slate-900">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-handshake-angle text-emerald-400"></i>
            <span>ZJU Alumni Association of NC: Strategic Expansion</span>
          </h3>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Zhejiang University Alumni Association of North Carolina (<a href="https://zjuaanc.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-blue-400 hover:underline font-medium">zjuaanc.org</a>), founded in 2012, has long championed innovation and academic excellence in the Research Triangle.
          </p>
          <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
            Building upon strong prior joint initiatives—such as the AI-Native Agent Security series, Physical AI lectures, and the 1st North American Chinese AI Music Competition—this agreement elevates the partnership into an integrated four-chapter alliance.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Summary & Next Steps -->
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800 space-y-4 text-xs text-slate-300">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-flag text-blue-400"></i>
            <span>Looking Ahead</span>
          </h4>
          <p class="leading-relaxed">
            Chapter presidents <strong>Michael Huo</strong> (NorCal), <strong>Dr. Qilei Peng</strong> (Silicon Valley), <strong>Rose Li</strong> (North Carolina), <strong>Bin Liu</strong> (Greater Washington DC), and ZJUAANC leadership jointly expressed confidence that this milestone bridges regions and provides alumni with broader opportunities for growth, entrepreneurship, and camaraderie.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Quick Links Grid -->
        <div class="pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-xs">
          <a href="https://norcal.nacuaa.ai" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-blue-400 border border-slate-800 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-link text-[10px]"></i>
            <span>NorCal norcal.nacuaa.ai</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://sv.nacuaa.ai" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-blue-400 border border-slate-800 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-link text-[10px]"></i>
            <span>Silicon Valley sv.nacuaa.ai</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://nc.nacuaa.ai" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-blue-400 border border-slate-800 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-link text-[10px]"></i>
            <span>North Carolina nc.nacuaa.ai</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://dc.nacuaa.ai" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-800 text-blue-400 border border-slate-800 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-link text-[10px]"></i>
            <span>Washington DC dc.nacuaa.ai</span>
          </a>
          <a href="https://zjuaanc.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-blue-950/60 hover:bg-blue-900/60 text-blue-300 border border-blue-800/60 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1.5 font-medium">
            <i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-up-right-from-square text-[10px]"></i>
            <span>ZJUAANC zjuaanc.org</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
